---
import ExtensionRef from "../../components/ExtensionRef.astro";
---

<ExtensionRef
  extension="autoplay"
  title="Autoplay"
  id="api-autoplay"
  requires='<strong>The core and the <a href="#api-loop">loop extension</a>.</strong> Load loop first.'
  files={["autoplay.min.js"]}
>
  <p>
    Moves the slider on its own: one move every interval, or a continuous drift like a ticker.
    Both kinds always loop, so setting <code>autoplay</code> turns looping on and this extension
    needs the loop extension too. Without it, autoplay stops at the last slide and the console says
    so.
  </p>
  <p>
    Autoplay pauses while the slider is pressed, dragged or has keyboard focus, while the tab is
    hidden, and on <code>pause()</code>. Interval autoplay also pauses on hover. Neither kind runs
    under reduced motion.
  </p>
</ExtensionRef>
